rules.cpp:
- CPP: may start {{earliest}}–{{latest}}; the unadjusted benefit is at
  {{standard}}. Starting earlier cuts it {{earlyPct}}/month before {{standard}};
  deferring past {{standard}} adds {{latePct}}/month up to {{latest}}.

rules.gis:
- GIS: income-tested; up to ${{single}}/year (single) or
  ${{couple}}/year per spouse (couple), reduced {{reduction}}
  per dollar of taxable income excluding OAS.

rules.registered:
- Registered accounts: RRSP/RRIF withdrawals are fully taxable and count against GIS/OAS;
  TFSA withdrawals are tax-free and do not. Annual limits: TFSA ${{tfsa}},
  RRSP ${{rrsp}} (18% of earned income, capped).
